pageType: content
notes: 数据页语法：110pt 大数字占左三分之一，右侧一张极简折线图（仅蓝+灰），下方三列短注。
elements:
  - elementId: n-motif
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [48, 48, 4, 36]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: { type: solid, color: "#0038B8" }
  - elementId: n-no
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 44, 200, 20]
    content:
      fontFamily: "LXGW Neo XiHei"
      fontSize: 10
      color: "#6B6A66"
      letterSpacing: 2
      text: "02 · 品牌在数字里"

  - elementId: n-big
    elementType: text
    bounds: [48, 120, 300, 130]
    content:
      fontFamily: "Smiley Sans"
      fontSize: 92
      color: "#0038B8"
      lineHeight: 1.0
      text: 7.2<span style="font-size:40px;">万册</span>
  - elementId: n-bigc
    elementType: text
    bounds: [48, 260, 280, 60]
    content:
      fontFamily: "LXGW Neo XiHei"
      fontSize: 11
      color: "#101010"
      lineHeight: 1.6
      text: |
        在架图书总量——按「一岛一主题」
        动线陈列，不设畅销榜堆头。

  - elementId: n-rule
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [380, 120, 1, 210]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: { type: solid, color: "#D8D7D2" }

  - elementId: n-ct
    elementType: text
    bounds: [412, 120, 500, 20]
    content:
      style: "$h3"
      fontSize: 13
      text: 会员数（人）
  - elementId: n-chart
    elementType: chart
    bounds: [412, 146, 500, 184]
    data:
      cols: [year, members]
      rows:
        - ["2020", 1200]
        - ["2021", 2600]
        - ["2022", 4100]
        - ["2023", 6800]
        - ["2024", 9600]
        - ["2025", 13100]
    fontFamily: "LXGW Neo XiHei"
    legend: false
    xAxis:
      type: category
      gridLine: false
      axisLine: { color: "#101010", width: 1 }
      label: { fontSize: 9.5, color: "#6B6A66" }
    yAxis:
      gridLine: false
      label: { fontSize: 9, color: "#6B6A66", numberFormat: "#,##0" }
    series:
      - type: line
        encode: { x: year, y: members }
        lineColor: "#0038B8"
        width: 2.5
        smooth: false
        marker: { shape: circle, size: 5, fill: "#0038B8" }

  - elementId: n-notes
    elementType: text
    bounds: [48, 356, 864, 90]
    content:
      fontFamily: "LXGW Neo XiHei"
      fontSize: 11
      color: "#101010"
      lineHeight: 1.7
      text: |
        <p>七年，从 12 街区的旧店面到今天的 1,400㎡ 岛式空间；会员复购率 68%，客单价 86 元——数字不是目标，是「灯还亮着」的证据。</p>
        <p style="font-size:9px; color:#6B6A66;">数据为品牌手册示例口径（虚构品牌，示意经营数字）；图表只用克莱因蓝与灰阶，禁止第三色。</p>

  - elementId: n-thick
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [48, 470, 864, 4]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: { type: solid, color: "#101010" }
